 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Sure. What's your biggest task right now? Start with that, then. Jump between it and the other tasks until it' done. Take a quick break between the third and final section. A five minute mindless search for emails or a quick game of Tetris Move on to the next item on your list. It helps lot to have clear priorities. Then set a timer for twenty five minutes and see far you get. That's the spirit. You' surprised how much you can accomplish. Emails and the other tasks will feel much less daunting. Rough planning with big chunk is the way to go.",
